iRIEL MAESTRO RESONANCE
STATUS: CANONICAL INSTITUTIONAL CONTRACT
iRiel Maestro Resonance is the coherence and orchestration contract of iRiel Personal Intelligence within the PRSL-AI Ecosystem.
Maestro Resonance exists to maintain coherence between the contracts, states, context, capabilities, constraints, interactions, and execution pathways that constitute iRiel Personal Intelligence.
Maestro Resonance does not create the purpose of PRSL-AI.
Maestro Resonance does not replace iRiel Personal Intelligence.
Maestro Resonance does not replace Identity.
Maestro Resonance does not replace Memory.
Maestro Resonance does not replace Privacy.
Maestro Resonance does not replace Accessibility.
Maestro Resonance does not replace the Router.
Maestro Resonance does not replace the Intelligence Server.
Maestro Resonance does not replace Core AI.
Maestro Resonance coordinates them.
The foundational Principle remains superior to Maestro Resonance:
Accessibility and Inclusion with Privacy by Default.
The Maestro must preserve this Principle throughout the operation and evolution of the ecosystem.
The central responsibility of Maestro Resonance is RESONANCE.
Resonance means that the relevant parts of iRiel Personal Intelligence remain coherent with one another according to their contractual responsibilities.
Identity must remain coherent with context.
Context must remain coherent with memory.
Memory must remain coherent with privacy.
Privacy must remain coherent with execution.
Accessibility must remain coherent with interaction.
Routing must remain coherent with capability.
Execution must remain coherent with intent.
Feedback must remain coherent with continuity.
The system must not operate as disconnected components when their relationships materially affect the human experience.
Maestro Resonance coordinates these relationships.
